Z||000000||Tabs31||12-14-2001||05:35 PM||||Well today I got my IRM catalog in the mail. It took 4 months for me to get it. I e-mailed them back in September for it and after awhile I was thinking that I was never going to get it. The catalog is nothing but a bunch of paper with black and white pictures held together by a single staple in the corner. What ever happened to taking pride in what you do.<P>when I asked the fiero store to send me a catalog I got it the next week and it was in colour.<P>If it took 4 months for me to get a dumbass looking catalog from IRM,How long will it take them to ship out parts if I ever and I do mean ever order from them????? <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tabs31_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
