Z||000014||Raydar||12-15-2001||09:58 AM||||IRM is owned by Jim and Barbara Sutter. Jim's main source of income is an electronics business that he also owns. Jim had a stroke a couple of years back. so they've had to slow down quite a bit. But they still sell Fiero stuff because they love Fieros. <BR>They *are* good people. You've just gotta be patient.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||14
Z||000015||Jay||12-15-2001||01:33 PM||||I must apologize, I thought we were talking about RSM not IRM, gets a little confusing.  I've never delt with IRM but have heard good things about them, wish I could say the same about RSM.||||reg||1
Z||000016||lou||12-15-2001||03:34 PM||||Since the very beginning, IRM has been responsible for a HUGE amount of research and development on Fiero aftermarket parts.  They are excellent people who have suffered a personal setback.  Inspite of this they have continued to provide the best service that they can under the circumstances.  Some of their original creations have been copied and sold by others yet they still provide us the best quality parts and service that they can given the circumstances.  This is not because they profit but because they are true Fiero enthusiast and truly wonderful people.||||reg||1
