Z||000021||Philphine||12-16-2001||06:34 AM||||i got kind of aggravated when i first ordered their catalog and more so when i got my first fiberglass pieces from them. but i since then got glass parts from other places and unless it's a large volume business (like someone who makes mustang or vette parts, but i've waited on some of them too) it always takes a while. the one non-glass part i ordered from them (egr tube) i got in about 5 days.<P>i've also never experienced the not being able to call them, though i have called when the main woman's not there and have to call back (they've got a new person taking orders too so thats a little better also). i also just used their email addy to arrange a delivery since i'm still away from home (i should have a new indy scoop waiting when i get back  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ).<P>having delt with a few other places i cut them more slack now. i like what i get from them and if i have to wait that's just how it is.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Phil T.<P>ain't no place like home,<BR>ain't no place like home,<BR>ain't no place like home.||||reg||1
